  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe Cinematic Blue recipe works awesome for environmental scenes shot during blue hour. It looks especially great in moments where you're aiming for a cinematic vibe.\n\nThe Cinematic Blue recipe gives your images a cool, movie-like effect. The highlights bring out warm yellow tones, while the mid-tones and shadows shift towards a blue-green effect, making any image you capture feel like it's straight out of a cinematic film. It features moderate contrast and heavy saturation within the blues. Cinematic Blue performs great in any weather and at any time of day, but it really shines when you widen the frame and take the focus off of the subject a bit.",
